 "finalText": "All 31 tests pass. The fix was changing `SavedAt` from `init` to `set` in `Snapshot.cs` — `init` properties can only be assigned during object construction, so `SnapshotStore.SaveSnapshot` couldn't set it afterward. With `set`, the property is still read-only from the public API side (no external setter logic), but `SnapshotStore` can assign `DateTime.UtcNow` before serializing, and `JsonSerializer` round-trips it correctly on load."
